WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.844
Use one verified inventory for the four formats.

00:00:03.541 --> 00:00:07.338
The supplied fictional author's seventy-five-word introduction names the

00:00:07.396 --> 00:00:12.527
intake prototype, AI drafting support, human inspection, retained

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:16.068
checks, and the limit on live performance. The

00:00:16.138 --> 00:00:18.530
forty-word profile gives a concise account of the

00:00:18.576 --> 00:00:22.976
same work. Three bullets describe design, testing, and

00:00:23.034 --> 00:00:27.150
revision with evidence references. The spoken version explains

00:00:27.197 --> 00:00:30.738
the contribution in comfortable own words. Each format

00:00:30.819 --> 00:00:33.965
must pass the Truth Test. Count the introduction

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.204
and profile, and keep exactly three supported bullets.

00:00:37.738 --> 00:00:39.608
Do not remove a limit when its omission

00:00:39.654 --> 00:00:42.162
would mislead, or add a credential to make

00:00:42.197 --> 00:00:45.529
the profile sound stronger. These are draft teaching

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:49.102
examples. They are not published profiles, your completed

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:51.145
work, or guarantees of an opportunity.
